# Code owners for the security / CI trust boundary.
#
# Every change to the paths below requires review from the owners listed here.
# Enforce it in branch protection with "Require review from Code Owners" on the
# default branch. This is what stops a PR from quietly loosening a scanner, a
# hook, a workflow, a pin, or the exception policy.
#
# NOTE for maintainers: @neur0map is the repo owner and a guaranteed reviewer.
# Replace it with a dedicated security team handle (e.g. @ryoku-dev/security) if
# one exists. CODEOWNERS entries MUST be collaborators or a team or GitHub
# silently ignores the rule.

# CI workflows, scanner installers, and trusted tool configs.
/.github/workflows/            @neur0map
/.github/scripts/              @neur0map
/.github/security/             @neur0map
/.github/CODEOWNERS            @neur0map
/.github/dependabot.yml        @neur0map

# Local git hooks and their opt-in installer.
/.githooks/                    @neur0map
/tools/install-hooks.sh        @neur0map

# The shared scanner and its tests.
/tools/security-screen.py      @neur0map
/tests/test_security_screen.py @neur0map

# The security exception policy (allowlist). Every exception is an owner
# decision; never let it be self-approved in a contribution.
/security/                     @neur0map
